12
00:00:47,041 --> 00:00:50,089
A hiss often points to a refrigerant leak,
good catch.

13
00:00:50,438 --> 00:00:53,774
Exactly, that's a classic sign of a
condenser issue.

14
00:00:54,124 --> 00:00:57,412
